url: "https://github.com/wahyuhardyanto/pinn-convection-diffusion-adaptive-collocation-v237"
abstract: >-
  Frozen reproducibility package for a transient one-dimensional convection-diffusion
  physics-informed neural network benchmark comparing MC-R, LHS-R, RAD-IID, and
  ALHS-R collocation strategies under a common physical-uniform residual objective,
  shared optimization prefixes, and a pre-specified statistical analysis plan.
keywords:
  - "physics-informed neural networks"
  - "convection-diffusion"
  - "adaptive collocation"
  - "importance sampling"
  - "Latin hypercube sampling"
  - "computational mechanics"
